proposal = "Update tools/launchpad/production/load/phase-2-scenario-manifest.json with the root-reviewed current task/spec mapping, consistent with the source-bound phase2 runner and owning coordinator. Preserve all live journey, duration and evidence assertions and do not infer full capacity from a host result."
